  "body": "Wake up to something truly special. Positioned on the top floor of one of Kensington Park's newer apartment buildings, this beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment captures an exceptional outlook across the Hauraki Gulf, with views stretching towards Great Barrier Island and the Coromandel Peninsula.\r\n\r\nThe spacious, covered deck is undoubtedly the star of the show. More than simply an outdoor area, it feels like an extension of the living space - a wonderful spot to enjoy your morning coffee as the sun rises over the water or simply sit and watch the ever-changing outlook throughout the day. With the protection of the covered roof, it can be enjoyed in all seasons.\r\n\r\nThe outlook continues north across the established greenery of Eaves Bush Reserve, with its beautiful native setting and walking tracks leading down towards Orewa Beach. From this elevated position, you can also enjoy views across the Kensington Park lake, creating a wonderfully varied outlook with something different to discover from every angle.\r\n\r\nInside, the apartment presents beautifully and feels fresh, modern and exceptionally well cared for. The generous open-plan living and dining area connects naturally with the deck, making it easy to enjoy the outlook from the moment you walk through the door.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen is both stylish and practical, with excellent storage, plenty of cupboards and drawers, and quality appliances, everything you need for easy everyday living or entertaining friends and family.\r\n\r\nThe spacious master bedroom is a lovely retreat, complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and a beautifully appointed ensuite. The second bedroom is equally versatile and is complemented by a second bathroom, providing comfortable accommodation for guests or family.\r\n\r\nThere is also excellent practical storage throughout, quality insulation and the added convenience of two car parks plus a lock-up storage area.  And when you want to head out and enjoy the coast, Orewa Beach is just a flat, easy walk away.\r\n\r\nFor those who value space, quality and an outlook that genuinely makes you stop and take notice, this is an apartment that deserves to be viewed.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the view for yourself - it really is something special.\r\n\r\nCall into the sales suite Tues - Sun 10am - 2pm and see Paul or Sandra to arrange a viewing.\r\nKensington Park Realty Ltd Licensed REAA 2008",
